>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">戸棚</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とだな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">壁橱；储物柜；衣柜；橱柜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219638\">この<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>戸棚<rp>(</rp><rt>とだな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这本书放在最上面的架子上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">土地</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">土地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">土</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">途中</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">路上；途中；中途；半路；中间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124585\"><ruby>途中<rp>(</rp><rt>とちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>であきらめるな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">别半途而废</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">特急</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とっきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</sp