<span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他一定是滥用了特权</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">咄嗟</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とっさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">瞬间；刹那；片刻</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149188\"><ruby>社長<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のとっさのひらめきなんだって。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它像闪电一样来到总统面前</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">取っ手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とって</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">把手；握柄；旋钮</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"157221\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>戸<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っ<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>付<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我把新的把手放在门上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">突破</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とっぱ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">突破；突破口；克服；战胜；渡过；实现；达到；超越；超过；超出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96493\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>敵陣<rp>(</rp><rt>てきじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>突破<rp>(</rp><rt>とっぱ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しようと<ruby>試<